hen lower weight, then account name; no averaging. Single-activity estimates included. Intervening target updates: True. Crossing frequency is the chosen practical estimate of encompassing coverage; a multi-band rise counts once. This does not interpret color steps as physical repetition units. Method: encompassing-report.md. Evidence: reference/mathacademy/encompassing-analysis-2026-10-11/frequency-fractions/differential-frequency-estimates.json, pair 1924->2023. All account evidence retained in the prepared import's selected-relationships.json." #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186428452 #edb/ref 1036 #edb/ref 17592186048746 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186486465 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186486469 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186486491 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186486515 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186486518 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1045 "Inhibited Growth Models With First-Order ODEs" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186486491 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046659 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049406 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485753 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "304e96a5-bdbf-59f8-bb8b-043de32c4a6c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485774 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{\\text{d}H}{\\text{d}t}=-k(75+H)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485774 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485774 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "04278896-0d0b-5abb-8627-033b3e542c42" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485785 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{\\text{d}H}{\\text{d}t}=k{H}^{2}(75-H)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186485785 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 1759218604